(Now we need to assemble transport leg and link to nodes.)
(We have origin_node_ready true, origin_node_occupied true, destination_node_ready true, destination_node_occupied true. Also origin_availability_confirmed true, destination_availability_confirmed true. Also origin_availability_locked true, destination_availability_locked true. Also we have transport_leg_available transport_leg_alpha (still true, we haven't used it). Good.)
(Now we need to assemble transport leg. Which assemble action to use? We need origin_leg_loaded and destination_leg_loaded? Goal does not require those; only requires transport_leg_assembled and links to nodes. So we can use assemble_transport_leg (basic) which requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available. All these are true now. So we can use assemble_transport_leg.)
